# Local development runtime state. This directory holds the PostgreSQL cluster, the local
# identity database with its password hashes, the loopback certificates, and
# secrets.clixml — which carries every database role password and the certificate
# password in recoverable form. None of it is reproducible from this repository, and
# none of it may ever be committed. Only *.pfx and *.key were previously excluded, which
# left the secrets file itself tracked.
.local/

# Response bodies a curl config wrote to the repository root because a Windows path was
# read as an escape sequence. Transient output, never source.
